description: Language and comment style for this KSP autopilot plugin
alwaysApply: true
---

# Language

- Write all source code in English: identifiers, strings, logs, build messages, and comments.
- In-game UI is English (IMGUI labels, buttons, window titles).
- Keep `README.md` in Portuguese unless asked otherwise.

# Comments

- Comment only when the reason is not obvious from the code.
- Keep comments short. Do not narrate what the next line does.
- Prefer no comment over a redundant one.
